=2 Walkthrough
>Reisenjima
!Updated marked map reisenjima.jpeg||Updated marked map reisenjima
* **{c=red:Note: }** Bring 3 {@i:Hoptoad|6613} {i:Hoptoad|Hoptoad|6613} and an {@i:Eastern Ginger|2645} {i:Eastern Ginger|Eastern Ginger|2645} to save time.
* Speak with {n:Reikuu} (K-8) near **Ethereal Ingress #6** in {p:Reisenjima} for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
* **Head to Ethereal Ingress #10** and speak with {n:Incantrix} for another cutscene.
** You must choose the option "__No, of course not__" in order to continue with the Mission.
* Head to (H-6) between **Ethereal Ingress #3 & #5** in {p:Reisenjima} and examine **Suspicious Overgrowth** for a cutscene.
** Gessho will ask for 3 {@i:Hoptoad|6613} {i:Hoptoad|Hoptoad|6613} and an {@i:Eastern Ginger|2645} {i:Eastern Ginger|Eastern Ginger|2645}.
*** {@i:Hoptoad|6613} {i:Hoptoad|Hoptoad|6613} are obtained by fishing in {p:Reisenjima}, off the bridge near **Ethereal Ingress #2** with a {@i:Fly Lure|17405} {p:Fly Lure} or {@i:Lufaise Fly|17005} {i:Lufaise Fly|Lufaise Fly|17005} and any rod.
**** The bite rate may vary depending on your fishing rod and whether you have {@k} {k:Frog Fishing}. __(verification needed)__
**** With {i:Lu Shang's F. Rod|Lu Shang's F. Rod|17386} or {i:Ebisu Fishing Rod|Ebisu Fishing Rod|17011} and sufficient skill, the bite rate is nearly 100%, even without the KI.
*** {@i:Eastern Ginger|2645} {i:Eastern Ginger|Eastern Ginger|2645} can be harvested in {p:Reisenjima} (touching **Grimslight** requires {@k} {k:Reaper}), harvested in {z:Bhaflau Thickets} or found in treasure caskets in {p:Reisenjima}.
**** {@k} {k:Reaper} is sold by {n:Shiftrix} (F-12) for 50 {p:Silt}.
* Trade the items to the **Suspicious Overgrowth** for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Reikuu} (K-8) near **Ethereal Ingress #6** for the final cutscene and your reward.

